   ],
   "text": "family and friends of the Operator who lost his life.",
   "conf": 0.9999,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    70.9,
    404.8,
    523.1,
    416.8
   ],
   "text": "2. The investigation and report contain valuable information which can be used to address the",
